 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.23017.1001) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.13 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging the game speed to anything other than 1.0x and closing the game by hitting X will cause the game speed text to show the number set before closing the game (Actual game speed will still be 1.0x).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open any project\n2. Make sure \"Embed game on next play\" and \"Make game workspace floating on next game\" are on\n3. Run the project\n4. Change the game speed to anything other than 1.0x (For this example use 1/4x)\n5. Close the game by hitting the X button (Not by clicking \"Stop running project\")\n6. Run the project again\n\nExpected result: The text on the game speed will default back to 1.0x\nActual result: The text on the game speed will be the same as before closing it (1/4x)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A (seems to happen in any project)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false